 'GOLD GULLAK SCHEME — STAFF TRAINING GUIDE
==========================================

ABOUT SUN SEA JEWELLERS
------------------------
• Established 1984 — 46+ years of trust
• 1984–2005: Maliwara, Chandni Chowk
• 2005–now: Karol Bagh (new showroom since 2023)
• MMTC Authorised Dealer
• Team of 35+ experts
• 150+ Gullak Scheme members enrolled (growing every month)

WHAT IS THE GOLD GULLAK SCHEME?
---------------------------------
A monthly gold coin savings plan where the customer:
• Buys 1gm MMTC Gold Coin every month
• Scheme runs for 2 years
• Is fully flexible — pause, stop, or resume any time
• Joins with basic KYC + documentation
• Gets a personal Gullak box (serialised, named)

THE GULLAK BOX
--------------
• Special metal box for storing gold coins
• Each box contains: Pyrite crystal stone + scheme document
• Personalised: member name, phone number, serial number on box
• Pyrite = prosperity crystal (multiplies wealth when kept securely)
• Max 500 members total — first come, first served

GOLD COIN DETAILS
-----------------
• MMTC 999.9 Pure Gold Coin — certified
• In partnership with Swiss PAMP Suisse (world''s best gold refinery)
• Purity comparison:
  MMTC coins:          999.9  ← what we sell (best)
  Tanoy/Malabar brand: 999
  Local retailers:     995
• Available sizes in scheme (monthly): 1gm, 2gm, 5gm, 8gm, 10gm
• Bigger sizes (20gm, 50gm, 100gm): available any time outside the scheme

SCHEME TERMS
------------
• KYC + basic documents to join
• 2-year scheme, buy 1gm coin every month
• No lock-in — pause, stop, resume any time, no penalty
• Doorstep delivery: Delhi NCR, free if within 15km of Karol Bagh or near Metro
• Sell back: to us OR anywhere at current market rate, any time

CAPACITY: Max 500 members. First come, first served. 150+ already enrolled.

WHY BETTER THAN BANK / FD? (key pitch points)
----------------------------------------------
Bank account:  2.5%–6% returns only
FD:            max 7.5%, with 5-year lock-in + capital gains tax (eats 10%+ more)
Gold Gullak:   15%–20% average returns historically
Gold last 2 years: 4x returns
Gold minimum YoY return historically: 10%+

KEY LINE TO USE: "If you need just ₹25,000, sell only 2gm of gold — the rest
stays intact. You cannot break an FD in half."

WHY NOT GOLD ETF?
-----------------
• ETF = paper trading — you don''t hold physical gold
• ETF has buy/sell price variation = losses over time
• Our scheme = physical gold in your hands. Real asset, real value.

PRICING & PAYMENTS
------------------
• Gold price changes daily with market — tell client to ask for "Today''s Gold Rate"
• Our price = MMTC official rate (discounted vs MMTC website + local stores)
• No hidden making charges on coins
• Payment accepted: Cash, UPI, NEFT, Bank Transfer
• Bill/receipt mandatory for every transaction

GOLD SIP APP — separate scheme
-------------------------------
For customers who say budget is too low (under ₹5000/month):
• Monthly Gold & Silver SIP Scheme
• Starts as low as ₹500/month or ₹100/day
• App: search "Sun Sea Jewellers" on Google Play Store or Apple App Store
• Pitch: "Don''t lose this golden opportunity — start small, grow big."

JEWELLERY (for jewellery queries)
----------------------------------
• Top trending designs, excellent craftsmanship, reasonable making charges
• Huge variety: Gold, Silver & Diamond Jewellery
• Sourced from export houses: Mumbai, Surat, Kolkata, Rajasthan
• Imported pieces: Italy, Dubai, Turkey
• Local karigar: only for urgent repairs
• In-house designers: 35+ years experience
• Custom designs: YES — any design we can make
• Brand copies: NO — but exclusive designer pieces available

CONTACT FOR GOLD RATE / QUERIES: 8860866000',
