F and the Gullak Scheme?","a":"ETF is paper trading — you don''t hold physical gold. ETF has buy/sell price variation causing losses. Our scheme = real physical gold in your hands."},{"q":"A customer says they can only spare ₹500/month. What do you pitch?","a":"Our Gold & Silver SIP app — starts at ₹500/month or ₹100/day. Search ''Sun Sea Jewellers'' on Play Store or App Store."},{"q":"What payment methods are accepted?","a":"Cash, UPI, NEFT, bank transfer — all accepted. Bill/receipt mandatory every time."},{"q":"Are there any making charges on gold coins?","a":"No hidden making charges. Price is based on MMTC official rate, discounted vs MMTC website and local stores."},{"q":"How many total members can join the Gullak Scheme, and how many are enrolled so far?","a":"Maximum 500 members. 150+ already enrolled. First come, first served."},{"q":"Is doorstep delivery available? Any charge?","a":"Yes — free doorstep delivery in Delhi NCR if within 15km of Karol Bagh store or near a Metro station."},{"q":"What is the benefit for someone already investing in gold?","a":"It is a personal secret saving in their own custody. No one in the family needs to know. Cash it out any time."},{"q":"Can a customer sell their gold coins? Where?","a":"Yes — sell to us or anywhere at current market rate, any time."},{"q":"What jewellery customisation can SSJ do?","a":"Any custom design — in-house designers with 35+ years experience. No brand copies, but exclusive designer pieces available. Can recreate/customise designs."}]',
